description = "A small Atomon formed from silicon-rich pebbles found along rivers and mountain paths.

Though quiet and unassuming, it is remarkably resilient, enduring countless impacts that would shatter ordinary stones.

It slowly absorbs minerals from its surroundings, causing its body to become denser and tougher over time.

When threatened, it hurls itself with surprising force or unleashes a barrage of sharp stone fragments.

Patient by nature, this steadfast Atomon is said to remain in one place for years, silently watching the world as the elements shape its growth."
